TITLE Pure water + fixed-pressure gas mixture at 150C
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7
    pe 4
    -water 1

GAS_PHASE 1
    -fixed_pressure
    -pressure 1
    -temperature 150
    CH4(g)  10
    CO2(g)  10
    NH3(g)   5

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.txt
    -reset false
    -pH true
    -pe true
    -temperature true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings Specific_conductance_uS_cm
10 PUNCH SC

END
